      "Text": "Security update for krb5",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for krb5 fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-107708: Denial of Service via malformed PAC in S4U2Proxy requests (bsc#1284816).\n- CVE-2026-107778: Denial of Service via crafted forwarded credentials (bsc#1284817).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
